# Header di sicurezza (Cloudflare Workers static assets) — copiare in public/_headers.
#
# CSP: tutto viene servito dal sito stesso. Se aggiungi contenuti esterni (sempre DOPO il consenso):
#   - Google Maps embed:        frame-src https://www.google.com https://maps.google.com
#   - YouTube (no-cookie):      frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com
#   - Cloudflare Web Analytics: script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com ; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com
# Sostituisci "frame-src https://www.google.com https://maps.google.com" con i domini necessari (separati da spazio).
#
# BOZZA: vedi il blocco "SOLO BOZZA" più in basso per nascondere il sito a Google.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; media-src 'self'; frame-src https://www.google.com https://maps.google.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

# ---- SOLO BOZZA: togli il "#" dalle due righe qui sotto. In V1 rimettilo. ----
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/assets/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/assets/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/.well-known/security.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
